LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RocketsDoAnythingForMoney::
    .string "TEAM ROCKET will do anything for\n"
    .string "the sake of money!\p"
    .string "There is no job too dirty, no deed\n"
    .string "too heinous, no crime too wicked!$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_CubonesMotherKilledByRockets::
    .string "I saw CUBONE's mother trying to\n"
    .string "escape from TEAM ROCKET.\p"
    .string "She was killed trying to get away…$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_PeoplePayForCuboneSkulls::
    .string "You know how the CUBONE species\n"
    .string "wears skulls, right?\p"
    .string "People will pay a lot for one.$"


LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MelodyOfferIgglybuff::
    .string "LAVENDER is quiet, but this\n"
    .string "IGGLYBUFF fills every room with\n"
    .string "songs.\p"
    .string "She's ready for a bigger audience\n"
    .string "than I can give her.\p"
    .string "Would you travel with her?$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MelodyDecline::
    .string "No pressure. She'll keep practicing\n"
    .string "with me.$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MelodyNoRoom::
    .string "Your party and PC can't take another\n"
    .string "POKéMON right now.\p"
    .string "Make some room and come back.$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MelodyGiftReceived::
    .string "Perfect. Keep the SOOTHE BELL with\n"
    .string "her.\p"
    .string "She sings best when she feels safe.$"

LavenderTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_MelodyPostGift::
    .string "I bet she's already found a new\n"
    .string "song out there.$"
